I'm slowly filling up the site with some past writings I deem interesting enough to showcase. I have accumulated so many digital and physical works that it will be a long and ongoing process to try and put them online. The order of their publication does not matter and means nothing, I just publish as I come across them. To identify any works done before the creation of this site, I will be putting them all in the [archives] category. The date tag (#YYYY-MM-DD) will indicate the date for which they are created or finished, any post with the tag #undated tag just means that I didn't have a date record for it. I may or may not edit a bit of spelling and grammar, as well as removing some things I'm not comfortable putting out here, but I will not add anything unless stated to be an improved work.